            "review_title": "Review at Ẩm thực chay Tỉnh quán",
            "review_text": "AbM\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nHidden Vegan Gem!\nJul 2022\nI found it accidentally on my way home. Very big selection of choices, and so friendly staff. I am not a vegan, 2/3 times a week suits me. But I have to admit, I was never aware of the fact that it can be so tasteful. My favorites are the pancakes! Coming back for that every time. I mix it with a soup on the side or salad/vegetables. Of course it is always to much, but cannot help myself. Prices are so good. Compared to the seafood places on the beach or town etc, it is quality/price so much better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 5, 2022",
